        q("chem-atomic-bonding-005","chem-atomic-bonding","Which shape is associated with a methane molecule, CH₄?",listOf("Tetrahedral","Linear","Bent","Trigonal planar"),0,"Four bonding pairs around carbon arrange tetrahedrally to minimise electron-pair repulsion."),
